{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49942","headline":"送日本使 · 明皇帝","name":"送日本使","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"日下非殊俗，天中嘉会朝。\n念余怀义远，矜尔畏途遥。\n涨海宽秋月，归帆[驶]夕飙。\n因惊彼君子，王化远昭昭。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"明皇帝","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_49942.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49942","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}